Terminal links require ctrl+click and a hover tooltip, neither of which exists
on touch - and the terminal is a Gesture target, so taps never even surface as
clicks. Open the tapped link directly by hit-testing the tapped cell against
the detected url/file/folder links (words stay tap-inert: nearly every cell
holds one and a tap must keep meaning focus), drop the modifier requirement
for any click that does reach a link on touch, and give the link quick pick a
long-press home in the terminal context menu.

